  "title": "Ph Life Insurance Handbook — 6. Bancassurance Partnership Privileges",
  "content": "## 6. Bancassurance Partnership Privileges\nFor depositors and account holders of our bancassurance partner banks (BDO, BPI, Metrobank, Security Bank):\n- **Fast-Track Underwriting**: Non-medical underwriting limit increased to ₱3,000,000 face amount for applicants aged 18 to 45.\n- **Auto-Debit Discount**: Zero processing charges and 5% first-year premium rebate when enrolling through bank branch referral ADA.\n- **Dedicated Bank Financial Specialist**: Seamless coordination at the partner bank's local branch.",
